 a young woman with long, flowing blonde hair that cascades over her shoulders and down her back. She wears a large, wide-brimmed straw hat adorned with delicate white flowers and green leaves on the right side. Her gaze is directed towards the viewer, creating an intimate connection.\n\nHer attire combines vintage elegance with modern casual style:\n- A rich red corset top made from satin-like fabric features intricate floral embroidery—white blossoms and small pink ones—and gold-colored lacing across the front.\n- Underneath, she wears blue denim shorts with frayed hems and similar embroidered details along the hemline.\n- Over this, she drapes a sheer, off-white or cream-colored kimono-style shawl. It has lace trim at the cuffs and armholes, as well as subtle flower patterns.\n- On her left shoulder rests a dark brown leather handbag with visible stitching.\n\nShe holds a Starbucks coffee cup in her lap; its design includes the iconic green mermaid logo. As if it were raining, there are tiny water droplets glistening on her legs and body parts. This detail suggests either a recent shower or morning dew after rain.\n\nThe background depicts a tranquil natural landscape under bright sunlight. Sunbeams filter through trees, illuminating golden particles floating around like dust motes in air. In the distance, rolling hills stretch into the horizon beneath a pale sky. To the far left, lush vegetation grows near what appears to be a stone wall or railing, adding depth to the composition.\n\nOverall, the image uses warm tones and dramatic lighting (high contrast between shadowed areas and brightly lit highlights) to create a dreamlike quality. There's a sense of gentle movement conveyed by how the wind blows strands of hair and petals. The overall mood is peaceful yet vibrant, capturing both solitude and joy within a beautiful environment."], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 50, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "Sho